id: flash-input-hold
section: Flash
item: A hold on a movie engages it (the first touch) and keeps the button down for its whole length; a drag sends moves along its path
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R5
wait text ready stage= 30
hold 240 272 2000
wait text up up 5
expect number heldms 1500 3200
expect number n-down 1 1
expect number n-up 1 1
drag 100 200 400 400 1000
# the drag's own release (the hold's, "up 201 150", already matched "up"): its end is at stage x 360
wait text up "up 3" 5
expect flash-el move 360 277 30
expect press-rate 20
